OL,3,AAsos shoppers sent pop-up message
OL,4,Aapparently from hackers threatening
OL,5,Aretailer
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos app users across the UK have seen
OL,8,Fa pop-up message that appears to have
OL,9,Fbeen sent by hackers - here's what
OL,10,Fcustomers are advised to do
OL,12,F"Dear Asos DPO and IT, we have fully
OL,13,Fcompromised the Snowflake instance.
OL,14,FEngage with us, or we will leak it,"
OL,15,Fthe message reads
OL,17,F"Snowflake" refers to a data storage
OL,18,Fcompany, whose popular tools have been
OL,19,Fused by dozens of firms for collecting,
OL,20,Fanalysing and storing data
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
